# Hotshot configuration.
#
# Model ids must be exact pi model ids in provider/model form (check with
# `pi --list-models "<pattern>"`).
# Reasoning effort must be one of: off | minimal | low | medium | high | xhigh | max
#
# Any value left empty is asked for at run time and written back here.
# The context model only reads; the executor model does the work.

HOTSHOT_CONTEXT_MODEL=""
HOTSHOT_CONTEXT_REASONING_EFFORT=""
HOTSHOT_EXECUTOR_MODEL=""
HOTSHOT_EXECUTOR_REASONING_EFFORT=""
